--- rand.int — generate a random integer. rand.int(max) or rand.int(min, max).
--- rand.float — generate a random float in [0, 1). rand.float(max) or rand.float(min, max).
--- rand.bool — generate a random boolean.
--- rand.pick — pick a random element from an array.
--- rand.choice — choose count elements from an array (with replacement).
--- rand.sample — sample count elements from an array (without replacement).
--- rand.shuffle — shuffle an array in random order.
--- rand.weighted_pick — pick an element from items using corresponding weights.
--- rand.string — generate a random string of given length from a charset.
--- rand.bytes — generate an array of random bytes (0-255) of given length.
--- rand.uuid — generate a version-4 UUID string.
--- rand.gauss — generate a random float from a Gaussian distribution with given mean and stddev.
--- rand.exponential — generate a random float from an exponential distribution with given lambda.
--- rand.poisson — generate a random integer from a Poisson distribution with given lambda.
--- rand.binomial — generate a random integer from a binomial distribution with n trials and probability p.
--- rand.perlin_1d — compute Perlin noise for a 1D coordinate.
--- rand.perlin_2d — compute Perlin noise for a 2D coordinate.
--- rand.perlin_3d — compute Perlin noise for a 3D coordinate.
--- rand.simplex_2d — compute simplex noise for a 2D coordinate.
--- rand.simplex_3d — compute simplex noise for a 3D coordinate.
--- rand.seeded_int — generate a seeded random integer. Deterministic for same seed + args.
--- rand.seeded_float — generate a seeded random float. Deterministic for same seed + args.
--- rand.seeded_bool — generate a seeded random boolean. Deterministic for same seed.
--- rand.seeded_pick — pick a seeded random element from an array. Deterministic.
--- rand.seeded_choice — choose seeded count elements from an array (with replacement). Deterministic.
--- rand.seeded_sample — sample seeded count elements from an array (without replacement). Deterministic.
--- rand.seeded_shuffle — shuffle an array with a seeded RNG. Deterministic.
--- rand.seeded_string — generate a seeded random string. Deterministic.
--- rand.seeded_gauss — generate a seeded random float from a Gaussian distribution. Deterministic.
cap "rand.int"
cap "rand.float"
cap "rand.bool"
cap "rand.pick"
cap "rand.choice"
cap "rand.sample"
cap "rand.shuffle"
cap "rand.weighted_pick"
